Wimalasekera, Documentation Manager of WorldLink Shipping
Colombo, had been read out, where the said Wimalasekera had
admitted that the said statement was correct and that there was
nothing further to be added. His oral evidence had also been led.
Finally, the Shipping Manager of the petitioner company, P.A.
Wickramarachchi, had been called, and his statement having been read
