Petitioner. Thereafter, the said portion of land had been handed over to
the Petitioner, and the 3rd Respondent had conveyed the said land to the
Petitioner by Deed bearing No. 780 dated 6th of September 1979(P8).
Accordingly, the Petitioner had been vested with the absolute title and
the ownership of the aforesaid land depicted in Plan P6.
