1 | Pag e
CA/HCC/0021/2023
Before : P. Kumararatnam, J.
Pradeep Hettiarachchi, J.
Counsel : Darshana Kuruppu with Tharushi Gamage for the Accused –
Appellant
Jehan Gunawardhana S.C. for the Respondents
Argued on : 20.06.2025
