case183.pdf.pdf,Civil,Administrative,"IN THE COURT OF APPEAL OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF
SRI LANKA
In the matter of an Application for
Orders/mandates in the nature of Writs of
