Colombo.
PETITIONER
Vs.
Court of Appeal Case No:
CA/WRIT/226/2022
1. The Honourable Minister of Lands,
“Mihikatha Medura”,
Land Secretariat,
No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Raod,
Battaramaulla.
2. Divisional Secretary,
Divisional Secretariat Badulla,
Badulla.
3. Secretary to the Ministry of Education,
Isurupaya,
