PETITIONER
Vs.
Court of Appeal Case No:
CA/WRIT/263/2024
1. Department of Debt Conciliation Board,
No. 35A, Dr. N.M. Perera Mawatha,
Colombo 08.
2. W. Iraangani Perera,
Chairperson,
3. W.C.Pushpamali,
Member,
4. Kusum Pathirana,
Member,
5. K.H. Premadasa,
Member,
6. K.P. Bandula Ranjith,
Member,
All of Department of Debt Conciliation
Board,
