CASE NO : CA WRIT 791/24
Vs.
1. Director General
Sri Lanka Customs,
Colombo 1.
2. U.A.N.R. Uduwila
Inquiring Officer,
Senior Deputy Director,
Sri Lanka Customs,
Colombo 1.
3. Minister of Finance
The Secretariat,
