Mayadunne Corea J
The Petitioner in this Application sought, inter alia, the following reliefs:
“c) Call for and issue a mandate in the nature of a writ of Certiorari,
quashing any order or decision of the 1st Respondent deeming that the
corpus which was decreed to the Petitioner by settlement entered in the
