and/or to any other third party on the premise the same is vested in the 1st
Respondent
f) Issue a mandate in the nature of a Writ of Certiorari, quashing the
decisions contained in the undated report (P28) made by the 9th to 11th
Respondents
g) Issue a mandate in the nature of a writ of Certiorari, quashing the
decision of the 1st Respondent as contained in the document dated
06.09.2023 (P29) that the Deed of Transfer bearing No. 2649 and dated
07.08.1972 made and attested by Kasinather Vaithilingam Margandan
Subramaniam of Batticaloa is null and void
