and that an appeal had thereafter, been preferred to the Wakfs Tribunal against
the said order, but it was also dismissed in Case No. WT/302/2024 on
26.04.2025, and an appeal is presently pending before this Court against the
CA/CPA/0090/2025 Page 25 of 32
said dismissal; and that in the meantime, the Wakf Board had made an order on
06/03/2024 directing the Director of Muslim Mosques and Charitable Trusts to
make an application and seek an order for the Fiscal to deliver possession of the
