in the Second Schedule thereof (namely, the 6th to 10th Respondent-
Respondents) (Vide- X-1B and X-1C); and that the said application was
supported ex-parte on 04/04/2024 and on the same day, the learned Magistrate
delivered an order allowing the application of the Petitioner-Respondent (Director
of Muslim Mosques and Charitable Trust or Wakfs) (Vide-X-1D); and that the
Petitioner became aware of the existence of such an order of Court only upon
