case, which stated that execution of the order would take place on 24/04/2024;
and that thereafter, on 22/04/2024, the members of the said Mosque (Jamaat),
had by way of a motion, made an application to the learned Magistrate to vacate
the said ex-parte order, and along with the said motion, a copy of the order made
by the Wakfs Tribunal on 20/04/2024 (X-1E), directing the learned Magistrate
