Page 1 of 7
Before: B. Sasi Mahendran, J.
Amal Ranaraja, J.
Counsel: Amila Palliyage with Sandeepani Wijesooriya, Savani
Udugampola, Lakitha Wakistha Arachchi and Subaj De Silva
