We note that there is no reason for us to disbelieve his version.
PW 5, P.S. Kapila Senaratne, corroborated the testimony of PW 1 and stated that
he, along with other officers, remained near the Buddha statue at the beginning
of the road until approximately 2:35 a.m., until the accused was apprehended by
