According to his testimony, although the witness had known the 3rd Accused for five years,
he failed to mention the 3rd Accused by name. Significantly, his evidence was recorded at the
hospital on the 19th. Yet, in that statement, he did not record that the Appellant and his
associates were attacking the deceased. This omission was duly marked, further casting
doubt on the reliability and completeness of his evidence.
PW-5, Ibralebbe Najeem, corroborated the testimony of PW-3. He stated that PW 4 informed
