not in itself sufficient to relieve the Judge of the duty of putting this alternative to
the jury "" if there was any basis for such a finding in the evidence on the record"".
26. In Premlal v Attorney-General [2000] 2 SLR 403, the Court of Appeal cited with
approval the following passage from the judgment of Lahore High Court in Jan
