of the weapon to the appellant. Moreover, it is of considerable significance that the
pistol marked P3 was not conclusively identified by PW1 as the firearm used in the
commission of the offence. Her evidence was only that the weapon used was similar
in appearance to P3. She stated as follows:
ප්රa : ඔබ සඳහන් කලා පළවෙනි චූදිතයා අවේ ඔබ පිස්වතෝලයක් තිවයනො
