The above-named Appellant was indicted in the High Court of Puttalam for
committing three counts of grave sexual abuse on the victim,
Weragodagamage Dinusha Lakmali punishable under Section 365(B) 2 (b) of
the Penal Code as amended by Acts No.29 of 1998 and No.16 of 2016. The
date of offence mentioned in the indictment was between 24.06.2015 to
23.06.2016.
The trial commenced on 09/07/2020. After leading the evidence of the
victim, PW2, the victim’s mother, PW7 WPC 2532, PW8 SI/Bandara and PW5
JMO who examined the victim, the prosecution had amended the 1st and 2nd
